                  {
                    "value": "In September, Chinese labs carried 58.5% of tokens but an estimated 39.7% of spend; US labs carried 28.9% of tokens and 60.3% of spend. The average token got 67% cheaper since January 2025, mostly because usage moved to cheaper models: the same models' list prices fell only 10%.",
